name: Verdant Leaf — random joker disable
author: corpus
description: >-
  Verdant Leaf disables one random Joker every hand. Ante 8 finisher: use many jokers or
  disable with Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: VerdantLeaf
    antes: [8]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: BaseballCard
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
